CLASS net/minecraft/class_1_270 net/minecraft/datafixer/file/cowfs/CowFs
	COMMENT A {@code CowFs} wraps the system’s file system to provide copy-on-write
	COMMENT semantics. An instance of this class starts out mirroring an existing
	COMMENT directory, and each regular file in this file system refers to the path
	COMMENT of a file on the underlying file system. When a write is requested to a
	COMMENT file on the {@code CowFs}, the underlying file is copied to a file in a
	COMMENT temporary directory. When a new file is created on the {@code CowFs},
	COMMENT it is backed by a new file in the temporary directory.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT {@link CowFsPath} is a subclass of {@link Path} for a file or directory
	COMMENT within a {@code CowFs}.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT Either {@link #createHardLinks} or {@link #copyLinks} can be used to
	COMMENT transfer the file tree represented by a {@code CowFs} to a new directory.
	COMMENT The former relies on support for hard links, while the latter does not.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT {@code CowFs} is used for upgrading a world save’s file structure.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT Moo.
